  <text id="section-label" x="60" y="58" width="320" height="22" font="caption" color="amber-warn" wrap="false">06 — LIVE COMMAND EXAMPLES</text>
  <text id="title" x="60" y="105" width="900" height="52" font="heading" size="40" color="text-main" wrap="false">Same terminal. Better decisions before execution.</text>
  <text id="intro" x="60" y="177" width="920" height="34" font="body" size="18" color="text-muted">GuardShell responds proportionally: it permits safe inspection, explains change, guides risk, and blocks critical damage.</text>
